{%- comment -%}
  One brand chip. Used by the home page's "Most Loved Houses" row and by the
  A–Z cloud on the brands hub, which were identical markup in two places.

  Usage: {% render 'brand-chip', brand: brand %}

  Deliberately text-only. Logos were rendered here from each collection's own
  image, but only 25 of the 50 brands have one, so the A-Z grid read as half
  finished — some cards with a mark, some without, and the wordmarks at wildly
  different visual weights. A uniform text chip is better than an inconsistent
  one. The collection images are untouched in admin and still used elsewhere;
  this snippet simply no longer draws them.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign brand_name = brand.title | remove: ' Perfumes' -%}
<a class="brand-chip" href="{{ brand.url }}">
  <span class="brand-chip-name">{{ brand_name }}</span>
  {%- if brand.products_count > 0 -%}
    <span class="brand-chip-n">{{ brand.products_count }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
</a>
